-- נספח א'6 — טבלת המרה לשכר מורים קיימים בדרגת 'מוסמך' (קוד דירוג 105), מעודכנת החל מיום 1.9.2016: the conversion
-- table of an existing teacher of the certified rank (מוסמך) (rating code 105) from 1.9.2016, as the
-- conditions-of-service portal publishes it. It is annex א'6 of the
-- September 2016 agreement (30.9.2016), whose §5(א) makes annexes א'1–א'7
-- the combined-salary tables from that day and which the corpus holds
-- without its annexes: the agreement takes each cell as a named input
-- (imported). A conversion table is the salary table with the intermediate
-- grades, "for the conversion only" (the base agreement's §46(א)).
--
-- What the agreement says of it, checked here over every cell: it
-- replaces the table in force on 31.8.2016 (annex א'6 of 1.1.2015,
-- imported) and pays less than that only in grades 6.5–9 (§5(ב)(1)(א)), so
-- every cell to grade 6 is the cell of 1.1.2015 and every cell from grade
-- 6.5 below it. Its steps — 2% and 1% beside the rows,
-- 7.5% to every whole grade, each intermediate grade the mean of its
-- neighbours — are checked against its cells.
--
-- The corpus prints the header's first cells as "דרגה 1" over the
-- seniority column and a blank over grade 1's; the amounts stand in their
-- columns, grades 1 to 9 by halves, and are read so.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT `base-agreement-46`
IMPORT `tables-common`
IMPORT `2015-01-01_ofek-hadash_salary-tables_morim`
IMPORT `2016-09-30_ofek-hadash_september-2016-agreement`

§ `נספח א'6 — טבלת המרה לשכר מורים קיימים בדרגת 'מוסמך' (קוד דירוג 105), 1.9.2016`

